From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:12:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Let CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT reach the DXE
 modules

With CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT the first [LibraryClasses] section maps
BaseCryptLib and TlsLib to DxeCryptLib, the client of the crypto
protocol of CryptoDxe, so that one copy of OpenSSL serves every DXE
module. Three later sections, [LibraryClasses.common] and the X64
DXE_CORE and DXE_DRIVER ones, map BaseCryptLib back to the static
library unconditionally, and they win: the build added CryptoDxe, with
its OpenSSL, to five modules that kept their own.

Keep those three mappings for CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT == FALSE only.
Runtime drivers keep RuntimeCryptLib, as the protocol is not there at
runtime, and CryptoDxe itself keeps the static library through its
component override.

For the payload of the W541: the modules of the volume go from 9.8 to
7.5 MiB, SecurityStubDxe, FmpDxe, SecureBootConfigDxe and
UserAuthenticationDxe from 800-1000 KiB each to 30-90 KiB, and the
compressed payload in flash from 2147 to 2032 KiB, since LZMA was
already finding most of the repeated OpenSSL code.

TEST=The nri payload of ouroBIOS built with -D CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT=TRUE
passes tools/qemu-smoke.py in QEMU q35 (the setup, the SMMSTORE
variables, iPXE, CSMWrap, the runtime services relocated); the capsule
update through the protocol, tools/qemu-update.py, in the CI.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
index 36302f1..bf390fe 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -530,7 +530,9 @@
   CpuPageTableLib|UefiCpuPkg/Library/CpuPageTableLib/CpuPageTableLib.inf
 
 [LibraryClasses.common]
+!if $(CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT) == FALSE
   BaseCryptLib|CryptoPkg/Library/BaseCryptLib/BaseCryptLib.inf
+!endif
 
 !if $(TPM_ENABLE) == TRUE
   Tpm12CommandLib|SecurityPkg/Library/Tpm12CommandLib/Tpm12CommandLib.inf
@@ -638,7 +640,9 @@
   AuthVariableLib|MdeModulePkg/Library/AuthVariableLibNull/AuthVariableLibNull.inf
 !endif
 
+!if $(CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT) == FALSE
   BaseCryptLib|CryptoPkg/Library/BaseCryptLib/BaseCryptLib.inf
+!endif
   IntrinsicLib|CryptoPkg/Library/IntrinsicLib/IntrinsicLib.inf
   OpensslLib|CryptoPkg/Library/OpensslLib/OpensslLib.inf
 
@@ -672,7 +676,9 @@
   AuthVariableLib|MdeModulePkg/Library/AuthVariableLibNull/AuthVariableLibNull.inf
 !endif
 
+!if $(CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT) == FALSE
   BaseCryptLib|CryptoPkg/Library/BaseCryptLib/BaseCryptLib.inf
+!endif
   IntrinsicLib|CryptoPkg/Library/IntrinsicLib/IntrinsicLib.inf
   OpensslLib|CryptoPkg/Library/OpensslLib/OpensslLib.inf
   RngLib|MdeModulePkg/Library/BaseRngLibTimerLib/BaseRngLibTimerLib.inf
